# Project standards

Follow `AGENTS.md`. It is the shared source of truth.

Before editing, read the docs it names for the task.

If a prompt conflicts with `docs/UI.md`, `docs/CODING_STANDARDS.md`, or `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, stop and propose a compliant approach.

Do not add a second copy of these rules.
